{"id":"n67862-2-3","stage":2,"title":"요 · 这","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67862-2-3-1","ko":"네가 그렇게 운동을 잘한다면서?","zh":"听说你运动很厉害？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"운동을","meaning":"运动","explanation":"운동：运动；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"운동","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69521","senseId":"3","lemma":"운동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"운동을","audio":"/audio/0ba24f283476666840e3.mp3"}},{"text":"잘한다면서?","meaning":"善于，擅长","explanation":"잘하다：善于，擅长；ㄴ다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"잘하다","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70073","senseId":"3","lemma":"잘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘한다면서","audio":"/audio/fa4e397e77a01718a474.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"d697e1a44df5b675","term":"운동","zh":"运动","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3","entryId":"69521","definition":"根据定好的规则和方法活动身体，较量能力或技术。","pronunciation":["운ː동"]},{"id":"039fa50765b5cd6f","term":"잘하다","zh":"善于，擅长","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3","entryId":"70073","definition":"熟练且手艺好。","pronunciation":["잘하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8113fbce64061c29fa91.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67862-2-3-2","ko":"아니에요.  달리기랑 축구 요 두 가지만 잘해요.","zh":"没有。我只擅长跑步和足球这两项。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니에요.","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"아니에요","audio":"/audio/2a86f32067c011ee9805.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니에요","audio":"/audio/2a86f32067c011ee9805.mp3"}},{"text":"달리기랑","meaning":"跑步","explanation":"달리기：跑步；랑：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"달리기","audio":"/audio/4c47747ba8ec10732144.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28388","senseId":"1","lemma":"달리기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달리기랑","audio":"/audio/01d44c8405a586442eaa.mp3"}},{"text":"축구","meaning":"足球","explanation":"축구：足球","readings":[{"term":"축구","audio":"/audio/c21dee4a35ad739ca03e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36700","senseId":"1","lemma":"축구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"축구","audio":"/audio/c21dee4a35ad739ca03e.mp3"}},{"text":"요","meaning":"这、这两种（指刚提到的跑步和足球）","explanation":"요：这、这两种（指刚提到的跑步和足球）","readings":[{"term":"요","audio":"/audio/d525e7107305db853261.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67862","senseId":"2","lemma":"요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요","audio":"/audio/d525e7107305db853261.mp3"}},{"text":"두","meaning":"两","explanation":"두：两","readings":[{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71458","senseId":"1","lemma":"두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}},{"text":"가지만","meaning":"种，项，类别，个","explanation":"가지：种，项，类别，个；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"가지","audio":"/audio/b16bec1ce2b9561977e6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId"